            "review_title": "Review at Le Vélo Bleu - Café & Bistro",
            "review_text": "Hoang H\n1 contribution\n0\nUnderrated sausage eatery, worth checking out!\nApr 2026 • Couples\nA standout local spot for sausage lovers! This small and cozy, French-inspired local eatery delivers bold, satisfying flavors with every bite. Fresh ingredients is a huge plus. The menu is simple but focused, making it easy to find a favorite, whether for a casual sit-down, quick takeaway or picking some sausage packs to cook at home. The cute souvenirs bring a local Vietnamese touch to the overall experience. A hidden gem among the streets of Ha Noi that everyone should visit at least once.\nRead more\nWritten April 25, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
