            "review_text": "nini p\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent sausages and perfect location\nApr 2026 • Couples\nI discovered Le Velo Bleu sausage shop while browsing Facebook once, and I ordered three flavors to be delivered to my home to try. Unexpectedly, they were very delicious!!! The flavors are unique and very aromatic. Most importantly, there are no additives or preservatives. This time, when I visited the shop in person, I was even more impressed because it’s very cute, sells souvenirs, and is especially conveniently located near the railway and in the city center, making it easy to get around.\nRead more\nWritten April 24, 2026",
